### Cropping a picture, and the image editor.

## The cropper's heading and hint

crop-square-title = Crop to Square
crop-square-hint = Drag to move. Drag a corner to resize.
crop-avatar-title = Crop Profile Picture
crop-avatar-hint = Drag to move, or drag a corner to resize.
# Above the cropped picture. Shown in capitals.
crop-preview = Preview
crop-unreadable = Couldn't read the image
crop-banner-title = Crop Banner
crop-icon-title = Crop Icon
crop-community-icon-title = Crop Community Icon
crop-confirm = Crop
crop-file-title = Crop Picture
crop-file-hint = Drag to move, or drag a corner or edge to resize.
# The cut's shape: any shape the drag makes.
crop-shape-free = Free
# The cut's shape: the picture's own.
crop-shape-original = Original
